  "body": "Auction: 8-12 The Promenade, Takapuna on Wednesday 25 November 2026 at 9:30AM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nDreaming of the perfect place to call home? Here’s your chance to turn that dream into reality and embrace the very best of coastal living!\r\n\r\nPositioned on a superbly sunny freehold site in one of Orewa’s most desirable streets, this beautifully presented, light-filled home feels as good as new. Just a short stroll from the golden sands of Orewa Beach, it offers the perfect blend of modern comfort, effortless living and an enviable coastal lifestyle.\r\n\r\nStep inside and discover a home designed for easy living and entertaining. The stylish modern kitchen connects seamlessly with the open-plan dining and living areas, flowing out to a private, sun-drenched patio. It’s the perfect setting for relaxed mornings, long summer lunches and evenings spent entertaining friends.\r\n\r\nThree generous bedrooms provide comfortable accommodation, with the privately positioned upstairs master bedroom offering an ensuite and a spacious walk-in wardrobe. A full family bathroom caters to the rest of the household, while double internal-access garaging, a heat pump and a whole-house water filtration system add to the everyday comfort and convenience.\r\n\r\nImmaculately maintained and wonderfully easy-care, this is a home where all the hard work has been done. Spend less time on upkeep and more time enjoying everything that makes Orewa so special. Wander down to the beach, grab your morning coffee at a favourite local café, or enjoy dinner and drinks at one of the many nearby restaurants and bars. With Orewa’s vibrant community and excellent amenities close at hand, everything you need is right here.\r\n\r\nHomes offering this combination of sunshine, quality, freehold ownership and beachside convenience are always in demand. With the owners ready to embark on their next chapter, this is your opportunity to secure a home where the living is easy and the lifestyle is exceptional.\r\n\r\nIt's time to make your move. Come along to our next open home or call today to arrange your viewing!\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
